  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 1.181,
      "text": "This drop is floating.",
      "words": 4,
      "words_per_s": 3.54,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 20.5
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "start": 1.45,
      "end": 4.353,
      "text": "Make the pan hotter, and it lasts longer, not shorter.",
      "words": 10,
      "words_per_s": 3.45,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.0
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "start": 4.6,
      "end": 8.679,
      "text": "On a warm pan, water touches the metal and sizzles away in seconds.",
      "words": 13,
      "words_per_s": 3.19,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.8
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "start": 8.9,
      "end": 12.337,
      "text": "But on a very hot pan, the underside flashes into steam.",
      "words": 11,
      "words_per_s": 3.2,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 16.8
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "start": 12.55,
      "end": 18.432,
      "text": "That steam cushion holds it up, and steam carries heat poorly, so the drop skates instead of boiling.",
      "words": 18,
      "words_per_s": 3.06,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 16.8
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "start": 20.45,
      "end": 26.196,
      "text": "Kitchen test on an empty pan: sizzling means not yet; skating beads mean ready to sear.",
      "words": 16,
      "words_per_s": 2.78,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 16.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "start": 26.45,
      "end": 29.733,
      "text": "Download Recall to turn your study material into lessons.",
      "words": 9,
      "words_per_s": 2.74,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.7
    }
  ],
